  "raw_text": "102 103 404\n\nB&w\n\nBROWN &WULLIAMSON TOIACCO CORPORATION\n\nApril 3, 1974\n\nMr. Charles Wiley c/o Allen-Martin Productions 9701 Taylorsville Road Louisville, Kentucky 40299\n\nDear Mr. Wiley:\n\nThis is to confirm my request that you arrange to print for VICEROY, four full ASI ads for Time-size kcylines. We will need your quote by 4/10.\n\n- I. Ad Description\n- A. Names anc Numbers:\n1. \"Flyirg Car - Moriise 11 V-MC-74-11\n3. \"Gold Trophy - Mertice 11 V-MG-74-13\n2. \"Blurred Car · Mortise II V-MG-74-12\n4. \"32 Drivers - Mortise' V-MG-74-14\n- B. Plcasc include the following information on these ads:\n1. Ad Namne\n2. Ad Number\n3. Magazine\n11. TT. Quantity requirements and spccifications:\n\n800 copies cach cn 50# Patina 7\" x 10\" printed on stock 13-1/2\" x 16\" (Min.) and 23\" x 20\" (Max.)\n\n- III. Timetab:e\n\nFirst Proof - 4/12\n\nComplete 4/17\n\nAds to L.A. - 4/19\n\n« 42\n\nPECD\n\nM.R.\n\n680079667",
